Step 6: Create the repository
At https://github.com, create a public repository named soc-home-lab with a README.
GitHub has no "new folder" button. Use Add file > Create new file and type a path such as docs/README.md; the slash creates the folder.
Repeat for detections/README.md and diagrams/README.md.
