Lessons learned
Check vendor support before picking an OS version. The newest Ubuntu LTS was not the right choice because Elastic had not yet listed it as supported.
Storage placement matters on mixed drives. Putting only the disk-sensitive VM on the SSD made the lab fit without buying hardware.
Reserving fixed addresses up front avoids rework once agents and domain members depend on them.
